  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ことり",
    "text": "「つばさしゃん！　嫌だぁ、つばさしゃんだけ先に落ちるなんて嫌だ！」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 65,
    "dress": "old-mizugi",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-mizugi_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -34,
      "y": 460
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "つばさ",
    "text": "「あたしだって嫌だよ。ずっと、ことりんのそばにいたかったよ……」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "つばさ",
    "text": "「でも、これは仕方ないことなの。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "つばさ",
    "text": "「あたしは『古いタイプのアイドル』、賞味期限はとっくに切れてる」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 65,
    "dress": "old-mizugi",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-mizugi_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -34,
      "y": 460
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "つばさ",
    "text": "「でも未来に希望を残せた、あたしの夢がつまった卵を産み落とせた。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "つばさ",
    "text": "「そこから、かわいい雛鳥が生まれた。その子は、あたしが辿りつけなかった高みまできっと飛べる」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "つばさ",
    "text": "「あたしが見られなかった景色を、たっぷり見渡して自由に飛ぶんだ」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "つばさ",
    "text": "「あたしは、そんなあなたをテレビの前で見てる。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 65,
    "dress": "old-mizugi",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-mizugi_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -34,
      "y": 460
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "つばさ",
    "text": "「この子はあたしが育てたんだよって、胸を張って。ふつうの主婦とかを、やってるよ」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 65,
    "dress": "old-mizugi",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-mizugi_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -34,
      "y": 460
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "つばさ",
    "text": "「いつか、そんな日は必ずくる。だけど、できるだけ遠い未来がよかったよ」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
